{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>For behold, darkness.</b> This is like the sense of 'For he will come like a pent-up stream' (Isaiah 59:19)." "<b>And thick darkness [over the nations].</b> It will cover the nations." "<b>And upon you YHWH will shine.</b> The sense: upon you alone."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 60, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:23.295747456Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}